  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BS-Good Samaritan HIV program in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Good Samaritan HIV Program in Ethiopia is working towards a reduction of the spread and prevalence of HIV and AIDS in the Ethiopian society. Through awareness creation, promotion of behaviour change, and preventive actions, Faith-based organisations are enabled to act as agents for change.</narrative>
  </description>
